-bhashyam/3-mundakam/2-khanda/3-2-5/#word-meaning","title":"Word Meaning","text":"<p>(To be added)</p>"},{"location":"upanishads/mundaka-bhashyam/3-mundakam/2-khanda/3-2-5/#bhashya","title":"Bhashya","text":"<p>(To be added)</p>"},{"location":"upanishads/mundaka-bhashyam/3-mundakam/2-khanda/3-2-6/","title":"Mantra 3-2-6","text":""},{"location":"upanishads/mundaka-bhashyam/3-mundakam/2-khanda/3-2-6/#mantra","title":"Mantra","text":"<p>(To be added)</p>"},{"location":"upanishads/mundaka-bhashyam/3-mundakam/2-khanda/3-2-6/#translation","title":"Translation","text":"<p>(To be added)</p>"},{"location":"upanishads/mundaka-bhashyam/3-mundakam/2-khanda/3-2-6/#word-meaning","title":"Word Meaning","text":"<p>(To be added)</p>"},{"location":"upanishads/mundaka-bhashyam/3-mundakam/2-khanda/3-2-6/#bhashya","title":"Bhashya","text":"<p>(To be added)</p>"},{"location":"upanishads/mundaka-bhashyam/3-mundakam/2-khanda/3-2-7/","title":"Mantra 3-2-7","text":""},{"location":"upanishads/mundaka-bhashyam/3-mundakam/2-khanda/3-2-7/#mantra","title":"Mantra","text":"<p>(To be added)</p>"},{"location":"upanishads/mundaka-bhashyam/3-mundakam/2-khanda/3-2-7/#translation","title":"Translation","text":"<p>(To be added)</p>"},{"location":"upanishads/mundaka-bhashyam/3-mundakam/2-khanda/3-2-7/#word-meaning","title":"Word Meaning","text":"<p>(To be added)</p>"},{"location":"upanishads/mundaka-bhashyam/3-mundakam/2-khanda/3-2-7/#bhashya","title":"Bhashya","text":"<p>(To be added)</p>"},{"location":"upanishads/mundaka-bhashyam/3-mundakam/2-khanda/3-2-8/","title":"Mantra 3-2-8","text":""},{"location":"upanishads/mundaka-bhashyam/3-mundakam/2-khanda/3-2-8/#mantra","title":"Mantra","text":"<p>(To be added)</p>"},{"location":"upanishads/mundaka-bhashyam/3-mundakam/2-khanda/3-2-8/#translation","title":"Translation","text":"<p>(To be added)</p>"},{"location":"upanishads/mundaka-bhashyam/3-mundakam/2-khanda/3-2-8/#word-meaning","title":"Word Meaning","text":"<p>(To be added)</p>"},{"location":"upanishads/mu